# The workspace's .gitignore leaves out every results/ directory (experiment output, Modules 7-11).
# Here a full run's summaries and report are kept, so that a later run, such as one after an
# optimization, can be compared with them. Its raw samples (perf_samples.csv, which run.py
# writes) and quick runs are not kept.
!results/
results/quick/
results/*/perf_samples.csv
